### Base Variables
@host = http://localhost:3000

### Sign In (returns cookies + CSRF token)
POST {{@host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Refresh Access Token (use refresh cookie from login)
POST {{@host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Cookie: erp_refresh_token={{refresh_token}}

### Fetch Current User Profile
GET {{@host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}

### Reports — List Datasets
GET {{@host}}/api/v1/reports/datasets
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}

### Reports — Describe Single Dataset
GET {{@host}}/api/v1/reports/datasets/fundraising_donations
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}

### Reports — Saved Definitions
GET {{@host}}/api/v1/reports
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}

### Reports — Run Donation Detail (JSON)
POST {{@host}}/api/v1/reports/{{donations_report_id}}/run
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{
  "filters": { "payment_method": "ACH" },
  "limit": 25
}

### Reports — Run Donation Detail (CSV download)
POST {{@host}}/api/v1/reports/{{donations_report_id}}/run?format=csv
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}
Accept: text/csv
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{
  "filters": { "is_recurring": "true" }
}

### Reports — Dashboard KPI Cards
GET {{@host}}/api/v1/reports/dashboard/cards
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}

### Communications — Create Message Draft
POST {{@host}}/api/v1/communications/messages
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{
  "channel": "Email",
  "subject": "Demo Announcement",
  "bodyText": "Hello {{firstName}}, welcome to the Community ERP demo!",
  "audience": { "contactIds": [1] }
}

### Communications — Send Draft
POST {{@host}}/api/v1/communications/messages/1/send
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

### Events — List Upcoming
GET {{@host}}/api/v1/events
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}

### Events — Create Draft Event
POST {{@host}}/api/v1/events
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{
  "code": "EVT-CLI-DEMO",
  "name": "Sample Community Meetup",
  "startAt": "2025-12-05T18:00:00.000Z",
  "timezone": "America/Los_Angeles",
  "capacity": 75
}

### Dashboard Snapshot
GET {{@host}}/api/v1/dashboard/snapshot
Cookie: erp_access_token={{access_token}}

### Calendar

GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/calendar/volunteers/{{volunteer_token}}

GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/calendar/events/{{event_token}}
